## 2. Commercial proprietary exemption (dual licensing)

The AGPL license above is the default for everyone, including commercial
organisations that are willing to meet its obligations. A separate **commercial
proprietary license** is available from the copyright holder for organisations
that cannot or do not wish to comply with AGPL §13 source-disclosure,
modification-notice, and share-alike obligations, and/or that wish to use the
book's text and figures commercially.

To request it, write to **research@twistpool.org** with your organisation, use
case, deployment model, and territory.

**No commercial right is granted by this file.** A commercial license takes
effect only when a separate written agreement is signed by the copyright
holder. Nothing here is an offer capable of acceptance by conduct, and no
price, term, sublicensing right, support obligation, indemnity, or patent
covenant is promised until that agreement exists. Until then, the AGPL and CC
licenses below govern your use.

